Error [E0003]: A Result handler success branch needs a payload binding
  --> tests/ui/result_handler_bad_binding.jet:3:13
    |
  3 |     value ? _ -> value ! error -> error
    |             ^
 Why: The compact handler exposes the success payload inside its branch
 Fix: Name the payload after `?`, for example `? ok -> ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
